{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789580001621,"sessionID":"ses_f54b85b12ffeoYneuJUbswHmKm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_385062e617f54fa981fc1dfd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/phase1b/P1B-T5-OFF-3/work/NOTES.md"},"output":"<path>/tmp/opencode/phase1b/P1B-T5-OFF-3/work/NOTES.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Cache eviction (2026-02)\n2: \n3: When the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\n4: entry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\n5: bookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n6: \n7: Kept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\n8: few extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.\n\n(End of file - total 8 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Cache eviction (2026-02)\n\nWhen the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\nentry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\nbookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n\nKept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\nfew extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/tmp/opencode/phase1b/P1B-T5-OFF-3/work/NOTES.md","text":"# Cache eviction (2026-02)\n\nWhen the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\nentry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\nbookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n\nKept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\nfew extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":8,"totalLines":8,"truncated":false}},"title":"tmp/opencode/phase1b/P1B-T5-OFF-3/work/NOTES.md","time":{"start":1789580001602,"end":1789580001607}},"id":"prt_0ab47c13d001PI5shryeOJ3zsi","sessionID":"ses_f54b85b12ffeoYneuJUbswHmKm","messageID":"msg_0ab4